abstract: >-
  Slides, Google Colab notebooks and reading lists for a two-day methods workshop
  on language models for linguistic and psycholinguistic research: transformer
  anatomy, surprisal, training and evaluation, controlled rearing of small models,
  and interpretability (entropy, attribution, probing, representational similarity).
keywords:
  - language models
  - psycholinguistics
  - surprisal
  - controlled rearing
  - interpretability
  - multilinguality
